theorem k215UnpairAt2248CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt2248State k215PNum2248 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt2248State k215PNum2248 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2248Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2248Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2248Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt2248ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt2248Reach16))));
